From 347b02dc5241b174670807f9205adf5811543efb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre <andre@rng.media>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:36:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] PhotoFox: RNG Media patches on PhotoCraft

Name, fox icon and brand mark, start screen (no Learn/community links,
accent New file button), About credits PhotoCraft without Discord, glass
graphite default theme with red accent, upstream self-update unplugged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
