Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:16:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] PhotoFalcon: fix RustSec advisories (lopdf 0.47, rmcp
 3.11, webpki-root-certs 1.0.12)

lopdf (test-only PDF reader) 0.38 -> 0.47 for the crafted-PDF stack overflow;
it now decodes simple fonts via /Encoding before /ToUnicode, so the PDF tests
read selectable text through a helper that honours /ToUnicode like Poppler.
